obs Honest accounting on the roster: I ran no cold open this lap, which is the directive I broke and the exact reason both findings arrived late. The hot pass closed at 164 green, 4 red, 3 gated, tree_moved=no; two of the four reds were mine and are closed above, and stash_record and standing_equipment stand as the tree found them.
recommend check-in (Keaton) -- the gate question that remains is yours and now costs 13 promises rather than 173 references: may a lost_promised_living cell be gated, given every promise standing today sits in dated testimony? The verdict-cache question from item 3 is still open beside it.
